*PocketReal is a mixed reality streaming app that brings VTubers and characters into your space.**\n\nEnjoy live streams and pre-recorded 3D content as if the characters were right in front of you.\n\n**Live Streams**  \nEnjoy live singing, dancing, chatting, and more\u2014all in real time.\n\n**Pre-recorded 3D Content**  \nEnjoy 3D content whenever you want.\n\n**Adjust It to Your Space**  \nAdjust the character's size and position to create the right distance and placement for your space.\n\nGo beyond the screen and experience characters as if they were sharing the same space with you.", "short_description": "PocketReal is a mixed reality streaming app that brings VTubers and characters into your space. Enjoy live streams and pre-recorded 3D content as if the characters were right in front of you."}]}, "developer_name": "POCKETREAL INC.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pocketreal.co.jp/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://pocketreal.co.jp/terms/", "publisher_name": "unity", "support_website_url": "https://pocketreal.co.jp/", "website_url": "https://pocketreal.co.jp/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28322606234047876"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623205_1099729071992366_8135040492622036651_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=10